.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally committed (both terraform/ and
# terraform/bootstrap/): CI deploys unattended, so provider versions must be pinned
# rather than re-resolved from "~> 6.0" each run. Generate it multi-platform on your
# Mac per DEPLOY.md before merging PR2.
# Never commit variable files — they hold the Google client secret / Apple .p8
# key for the Cognito IdPs (WHIT-97). Supply those via TF_VAR_* env vars.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
